{"pack": "star_wars", "title": "Emergency Powers Act", "url": "https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Emergency_Powers_Act", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"title-eraicons\" style=\"float:right;position:static;display:none\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Canon\" title=\"This article details a subject that is considered canon.\"><img alt=\"This article details a subject that is considered canon.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/b/be/Premium-Eras-canon.png/revision/latest?cb=20170617140440\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Premium-Eras-canon.png\" data-image-key=\"Premium-Eras-canon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></div><table id=\"canontab\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0;margin:0 0 5px 0;border-left:0;border-right:0;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;vertical-align:top\"><tbody><tr><td id=\"canontab-canon&#95;ctcw\" style=\"padding:5px 0 5px 0;background-color:#002e54;line-height:0.95em;font-size:150%;font-weight:bold;border-bottom:3px solid #002e54;min-width:170px;vertical-align:top;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0\"> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Emergency_Powers_Act\" title=\"This article covers the Canon version of this subject.\"><img alt=\"This article covers the Canon version of this subject.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/7/7d/Tab-canon-white.png/revision/latest?cb=20140430180745\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"170\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Tab-canon-white.png\" data-image-key=\"Tab-canon-white.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></td><td id=\"canontab-separator1\" style=\"width:3px;border-bottom:3px solid #002e54\">&#160;</td><td id=\"canontab-legends&#95;ctlb\" style=\"padding:5px 0 5px 0;background-color:#d8e9fc;line-height:0.95em;font-size:150%;font-weight:bold;border-bottom:3px solid #002e54;min-width:170px;vertical-align:top;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0\"> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Emergency_Powers_Act/Legends\" title=\"Click here for Wookieepedia&#39;s article on the Legends version of this subject.\"><img alt=\"Click here for Wookieepedia&#39;s article on the Legends version of this subject.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/2/28/Tab-legends-black.png/revision/latest?cb=20140430180745\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"170\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Tab-legends-black.png\" data-image-key=\"Tab-legends-black.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></td><td id=\"canontab-separator2\" style=\"width:3000px\">&#160;</td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"mobileTopIcons\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Canon\" title=\"Canon\"><img alt=\"OnACanonArticle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"41\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"OnACanonArticle.png\" data-image-key=\"OnACanonArticle.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/47/OnACanonArticle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20250314035517\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Emergency_Powers_Act/Legends\" title=\"Emergency Powers Act/Legends\"><img alt=\"GoToLegends\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"41\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"GoToLegends.png\" data-image-key=\"GoToLegends.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/c/cd/GoToLegends.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20171212195307\" /></a></span></span>\n</p><div class=\"disambig noprint darkbackground1\" style=\"border-radius: 10px; padding: 5px 0\">For other uses, see <b><a href=\"/wiki/Emergency_Powers_Act_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Emergency Powers Act (disambiguation)\">Emergency Powers Act</a></b>.</div>\n<div id=\"Update\" class=\"mobile-hide headertemplate messagebox noprint iumb hidable\" style=\"background: #EEE8AA; color: #000; border-radius:10px\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0px\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"iumb-table-container\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"hidable-content\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"iumb-icon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/4c/Z-95_Headhunter.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20080821014929\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Z-95 Headhunter\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"71\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Z-95 Headhunter.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Z-95_Headhunter.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/4c/Z-95_Headhunter.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20080821014929\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"iumb-main\">\n<p><span class=\"iumb-caption\">Content approaching. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Hope\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Hope\">Queen's Hope</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Catalyst:_A_Rogue_One_Novel\" title=\"Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel\">Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Reign_of_the_Empire:_The_Mask_of_Fear\" title=\"Reign of the Empire: The Mask of Fear\">Reign of the Empire: The Mask of Fear</a></i>&#8211;class.</span>\n</p><p><span class=\"iumb-message\">Parts of this article are no longer up to date.</span>\n</p><p><span class=\"iumb-comment\">Please update the article to include missing information, and remove this template when finished.</span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td class=\"iumb-hidable-button\"><span class=\"hidable-button\"></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Battle300 pi-layout-default\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedevents\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related events</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Separatist_Crisis\" title=\"Separatist Crisis\">Separatist Crisis</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Collapse&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Collapse-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"proposedby\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Proposed by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Junior_Representative\" title=\"Junior Representative\">Junior Representative</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Jar_Jar_Binks\" title=\"Jar Jar Binks\">Jar Jar Binks</a> <small>(proposed further amendment to the act)</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Episode&#95;II&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Episode_II-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/32/ILoveDemoracy-PrequelTrilogyGraphicNovel.png/revision/latest?cb=20260710035400\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"ILoveDemoracy-PrequelTrilogyGraphicNovel\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/32/ILoveDemoracy-PrequelTrilogyGraphicNovel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/500?cb=20260710035400\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/32/ILoveDemoracy-PrequelTrilogyGraphicNovel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/500?cb=20260710035400 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/32/ILoveDemoracy-PrequelTrilogyGraphicNovel.png/revision/latest?cb=20260710035400 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"ILoveDemoracy-PrequelTrilogyGraphicNovel\" width=\"270\" height=\"215\" data-image-key=\"ILoveDemoracy-PrequelTrilogyGraphicNovel.png\" data-image-name=\"ILoveDemoracy-PrequelTrilogyGraphicNovel.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Emergency Powers Act</h2>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\" data-item-name=\"mobile-eras\"><center></center></nav>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"dateproposed\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/24_BBY\" title=\"24 BBY\">24 BBY</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Timelines&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Timelines-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/22_BBY\" title=\"22 BBY\">22 BBY</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Timelines&#95;3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Timelines-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <small>(expansion of powers)</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Episode&#95;II&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Episode_II-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"government\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Government</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Republic\" title=\"Galactic Republic\">Galactic Republic</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Episode&#95;II&#95;2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Episode_II-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"legislativebody\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Legislative body</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Senate\" title=\"Galactic Senate\">Galactic Senate</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Episode&#95;II&#95;2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Episode_II-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"result\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Outcome</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Supreme_Chancellor\" title=\"Supreme Chancellor\">Supreme Chancellor</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Sidious\" title=\"Darth Sidious\">Sheev Palpatine</a> remains in <a href=\"/wiki/Office_of_the_Chancellor\" title=\"Office of the Chancellor\">office</a> throughout the <a href=\"/wiki/Clone_Wars\" title=\"Clone Wars\">Clone Wars</a> and exceeds his term limits<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Collapse&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Collapse-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <small>(24 BBY)</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Timelines&#95;3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Timelines-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li>Ability to bypass the <a href=\"/wiki/Military_Creation_Act\" title=\"Military Creation Act\">Military Creation Act</a> and establish the <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Army_of_the_Republic\" title=\"Grand Army of the Republic\">Grand Army of the Republic</a> by Palpatine<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Collapse&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Collapse-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <small>(22 BBY)</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Timelines&#95;3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Timelines-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"otherkeyindividuals\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Other key individuals</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Supreme Chancellor Sheev Palpatine<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Collapse&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Collapse-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><small><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Law\">[Source]</a></span></small></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><span>\"<i>By decree of the Galactic Senate, emergency powers have been granted to Supreme Chancellor Sheev Palpatine until the current Separatist crisis has abated. The motion was proposed by Representative Jar Jar Binks of Naboo and passed by a majority vote. The Supreme Chancellor shall relinquish these powers in good faith once&#8230;</i>\"</span></dd>\n<dd>&#8213;Galactic Senate decree<span class=\"noprint\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Star&#95;Wars:&#95;The&#95;Secrets&#95;of&#95;the&#95;Sith&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Star_Wars:_The_Secrets_of_the_Sith-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></dd></dl></div>\n<p>The <b>Emergency Powers Act</b> was an amendment to the <a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Constitution\" title=\"Galactic Constitution\">Galactic Constitution</a> passed at the very start of the <a href=\"/wiki/Separatist_Crisis\" title=\"Separatist Crisis\">Separatist Crisis</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/24_BBY\" title=\"24 BBY\">24 BBY</a> to allow <a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Sidious\" title=\"Darth Sidious\">Sheev Palpatine</a> to remain <a href=\"/wiki/Supreme_Chancellor\" title=\"Supreme Chancellor\">Supreme Chancellor</a> long after the expiration of his elected terms. The act was originally intended to remain in practice for as long as the Separatist Crisis carried on.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Passing_of_the_act\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Passing of the act</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Further_amendments\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Further amendments</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Legacy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Legacy</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Sources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Sources</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Notes_and_references\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes and references</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Passing_of_the_act\">Passing of the act</span></h3>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><span>\"<i>It's-a clear desa Separatists made a pact wesa desa Federation du Trade. Senators! Dellow felegates! In response to this direct threat to the Republic, mesa propose that the Senate give immediately emergency powers to the Supreme Chancellor!</i>\"</span></dd>\n<dd>&#8213;Jar Jar Binks<span class=\"noprint\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Episode&#95;II&#95;2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Episode_II-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></dd></dl></div>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 250px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/3c/JarJarBinks-SoPWP.png/revision/latest?cb=20260817032517\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Junior Representative Binks proposed increasing the scope of the Emergency Power Act.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"133\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"JarJarBinks-SoPWP.png\" data-image-key=\"JarJarBinks-SoPWP.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/3c/JarJarBinks-SoPWP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20260817032517\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/3c/JarJarBinks-SoPWP.png/revision/latest?cb=20260817032517\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Junior Representative Binks proposed increasing the scope of the Emergency Power Act.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/3c/JarJarBinks-SoPWP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20260817032517\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"133\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"JarJarBinks-SoPWP.png\" data-image-key=\"JarJarBinks-SoPWP.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/3/3c/JarJarBinks-SoPWP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20260817032517\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:JarJarBinks-SoPWP.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Junior Representative Binks proposed increasing the scope of the Emergency Power Act.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The Emergency Powers Act was voted into law by the <a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Senate\" title=\"Galactic Senate\">Galactic Senate</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/24_BBY\" title=\"24 BBY\">24 BBY</a> in response to the <a href=\"/wiki/Separatist_Crisis\" title=\"Separatist Crisis\">Separatist Crisis</a>, granting emergency powers to <a href=\"/wiki/Supreme_Chancellor\" title=\"Supreme Chancellor\">Supreme Chancellor</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Sidious\" title=\"Darth Sidious\">Sheev Palpatine</a> for the duration of the Separatist Crisis. In particular, the act allowed Palpatine to remain in office past the expiration of his term in response to the crisis.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Timelines&#95;3-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Timelines-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>On the eve of the <a href=\"/wiki/First_Battle_of_Geonosis\" title=\"First Battle of Geonosis\">First Battle of Geonosis</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Collapse&#95;1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Collapse-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/22_BBY\" title=\"22 BBY\">22 BBY</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Timelines&#95;3-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Timelines-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/Junior_Representative\" title=\"Junior Representative\">Junior Representative</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Jar_Jar_Binks\" title=\"Jar Jar Binks\">Jar Jar Binks</a> convinced the Senate to increase the scope of the Chancellor's emergency powers<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Collapse&#95;1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Collapse-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> because of the apparent threat of the <a href=\"/wiki/Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems\" title=\"Confederacy of Independent Systems\">Confederacy of Independent Systems</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Episode&#95;II&#95;2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Episode_II-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> With the expansion, Palpatine could bypass the <a href=\"/wiki/Military_Creation_Act\" title=\"Military Creation Act\">Military Creation Act</a> and form the <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Army_of_the_Republic\" title=\"Grand Army of the Republic\">Grand Army of the Republic</a>. Palpatine remained in power as Chancellor over the Clone Wars through<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Collapse&#95;1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Collapse-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> the expanded<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Episode&#95;II&#95;2-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Episode_II-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Emergency Powers Act.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Collapse&#95;1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Collapse-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Further_amendments\">Further amendments</span></h3>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><span>\"<i>Thank you all for attending. I know we can count on signatures, but I've invited this group to discuss the exact wording of the petition.</i>\"<br />\"<i>In broad strokes, our demands are that Chancellor Palpatine relinquish the emergency war powers granted to him, abolish the Sector Governance Decree, and begin cease-fire talks with Count Dooku's Separatists.</i>\"</span></dd>\n<dd>&#8213;Bail Organa and Mon Mothma, at the first of the Cantham House talks<span class=\"noprint\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Rebel&#95;Files&#95;5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Rebel_Files-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></dd></dl></div>\n<p>Four additional amendments were made to the Constitution and enshrined in law throughout the war, further expanding Palpatine's emergency powers. In effect, Palpatine became the most powerful chancellor since before the <a href=\"/wiki/Ruusan_Reformations\" title=\"Ruusan Reformations\">Ruusan Reformations</a>. One of the amendments was the <a href=\"/wiki/Reflex_Amendment\" title=\"Reflex Amendment\">Reflex Amendment</a>, which granted the Chancellor near-absolute power over military affairs, almost completely bypassing the Senate. Unbeknownst to the Senate, Palpatine was in truth a Sith Lord named Darth Sidious, and that he had deliberately engineered the <a href=\"/wiki/Clone_Wars\" title=\"Clone Wars\">Clone Wars</a> so that he could remain in office and plot the downfall of the <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Order\" title=\"Jedi Order\">Jedi Order</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Collapse&#95;1-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Collapse-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Passing the Emergency Powers Act was, in a way, the one of the many steps towards Sidious' goal to topple the Galactic Republic and replace it with the <a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Empire\" title=\"Galactic Empire\">Galactic Empire</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Episode&#95;II&#95;2-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Episode_II-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Legacy\">Legacy</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"noprint rellink\" role=\"note\"><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/0/04/Blue_Glass_Arrow.svg/revision/latest?cb=20090726033133\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blue Glass Arrow.svg\" data-image-key=\"Blue_Glass_Arrow.svg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/0/04/Blue_Glass_Arrow.svg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20090726033133\" /></a></span> Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/Charter_of_Chancellor\" title=\"Charter of Chancellor\">Charter of Chancellor</a></div></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><span>\"<i>The charter of Chancellor maintains the emergency powers granted by Palpatine, and they can persist no longer. They are a poison to democracy. They undercut my role.</i>\"</span></dd>\n<dd>&#8213;Mon Mothma<span class=\"noprint\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Aftermath&#95;6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Aftermath-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></dd></dl></div>\n<p>During the <a href=\"/wiki/Declaration_of_a_New_Republic\" title=\"Declaration of a New Republic\">restoration</a> of the Galactic Republic in the form of the <a href=\"/wiki/New_Republic\" title=\"New Republic\">New Republic</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Chancellor_(New_Republic)\" title=\"Chancellor (New Republic)\">Chancellor</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mon_Mothma\" title=\"Mon Mothma\">Mon Mothma</a> was granted the same emergency powers once granted to Supreme Chancellor Sheev Palpatine by the Emergency Powers Act. Mothma, however, intended to eliminate those powers because of their destructive effect on democracy.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Aftermath&#95;6-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Aftermath-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<table class=\"noprint stub\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/a/aa/Wiki-shrinkable.png/revision/latest?cb=20060123022626\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wiki-shrinkable\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wiki-shrinkable.png\" data-image-key=\"Wiki-shrinkable.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/a/aa/Wiki-shrinkable.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20060123022626\" /></a></span> This <a href=\"/wiki/In-universe\" title=\"In-universe\">in-universe</a> list is incomplete. You can help Wookieepedia by <a href=\"/wiki/Special:EditPage/:Emergency_Powers_Act\" title=\"Special:EditPage/:Emergency Powers Act\">expanding it</a>.\n</th></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Episode_II_Attack_of_the_Clones\" title=\"Star Wars: Episode II Attack of the Clones\"><i>Star Wars</i>: Episode II <i>Attack of the Clones</i></a> <small>(First appearance)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Hope\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Hope\">Queen's Hope</a></i> <small>(and <a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Hope_(audiobook)\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Hope (audiobook)\">audiobook</a>)</small> <small>(Indirect mention only)</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Jar_Jar_1\" title=\"Jar Jar 1\"><i>Jar Jar</i> 1</a> <small>(Mentioned only)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Catalyst:_A_Rogue_One_Novel\" title=\"Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel\">Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel</a></i> <small>(and <a href=\"/wiki/Catalyst:_A_Rogue_One_Novel_(audiobook)\" title=\"Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel (audiobook)\">audiobook</a>)</small> <small>(Mentioned only)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Reign_of_the_Empire:_The_Mask_of_Fear\" title=\"Reign of the Empire: The Mask of Fear\">Reign of the Empire: The Mask of Fear</a></i> <small>(and <a href=\"/wiki/Reign_of_the_Empire:_The_Mask_of_Fear_(audiobook)\" title=\"Reign of the Empire: The Mask of Fear (audiobook)\">audiobook</a>)</small> <small>(Mentioned only)</small></li>\n<li><span class=\"mhi\"><span class=\"mw-default-size mw-valign-text-top\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Bad_Batch\" title=\"Star Wars: The Bad Batch\"><img alt=\"TBBtemplate\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TBBtemplate.png\" data-image-key=\"TBBtemplate.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/9/94/TBBtemplate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20220102194547\" /></a></span></span> <i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Bad_Batch\" title=\"Star Wars: The Bad Batch\">Star Wars: The Bad Batch</a></i> &#8212; \"<a href=\"/wiki/The_Clone_Conspiracy\" title=\"The Clone Conspiracy\">The Clone Conspiracy</a>\" <small>(Mentioned only)</small></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources\">Sources</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mw