\">3.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Timelines_3-4\">3.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Timelines_3-5\">3.5</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Timelines\" title=\"Star Wars: Timelines\">Star Wars: Timelines</a></i></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Star&#95;Wars:&#95;The&#95;Secrets&#95;of&#95;the&#95;Sith-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Star_Wars:_The_Secrets_of_the_Sith_4-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Secrets_of_the_Sith\" title=\"Star Wars: The Secrets of the Sith\">Star Wars: The Secrets of the Sith</a></i></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Rebel&#95;Files-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Rebel_Files_5-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Rebel_Files\" title=\"Star Wars: The Rebel Files\">Star Wars: The Rebel Files</a></i></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Aftermath-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Aftermath_6-0\">6.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Aftermath_6-1\">6.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aftermath_(novel)\" title=\"Aftermath (novel)\"><i>Aftermath</i></a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"p-lang\" style=\"padding-left=0.5px; padding-right=0.5px;\">\n<div>In other languages</div>\n<div class=\"pBody\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"interwiki-el plainlinks\" title=\"el:Νόμος Εξουσίας Έκτακτης Ανάγκης\"><a href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/el/wiki/%CE%9D%CF%8C%CE%BC%CE%BF%CF%82_%CE%95%CE%BE%CE%BF%CF%85%CF%83%CE%AF%CE%B1%CF%82_%CE%88%CE%BA%CF%84%CE%B1%CE%BA%CF%84%CE%B7%CF%82_%CE%91%CE%BD%CE%AC%CE%B3%CE%BA%CE%B7%CF%82\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:el.starwars:Νόμος Εξουσίας Έκτακτης Ανάγκης\">Ελληνικά</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-es plainlinks\" title=\"es:Acta de Poderes de Emergencia\"><a href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/es/wiki/Acta_de_Poderes_de_Emergencia\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:es.starwars:Acta de Poderes de Emergencia\">español</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-ka plainlinks\" title=\"ka:კანონი საგანგებო უფლებამოსილებების შესახებ\"><a href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/ka/wiki/%E1%83%99%E1%83%90%E1%83%9C%E1%83%9D%E1%83%9C%E1%83%98_%E1%83%A1%E1%83%90%E1%83%92%E1%83%90%E1%83%9C%E1%83%92%E1%83%94%E1%83%91%E1%83%9D_%E1%83%A3%E1%83%A4%E1%83%9A%E1%83%94%E1%83%91%E1%83%90%E1%83%9B%E1%83%9D%E1%83%A1%E1%83%98%E1%83%9A%E1%83%94%E1%83%91%E1%83%94%E1%83%91%E1%83%98%E1%83%A1_%E1%83%A8%E1%83%94%E1%83%A1%E1%83%90%E1%83%AE%E1%83%94%E1%83%91\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ka.starwars:კანონი საგანგებო უფლებამოსილებების შესახებ\">ქართული</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-tr plainlinks\" title=\"tr:Olağanüstü Yetkiler Yasası\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://starwarsturkiye.com/wiki/Ola%C4%9Fan%C3%BCst%C3%BC_Yetkiler_Yasas%C4%B1\">Türkçe</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>"}